        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24532731?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rat-moonshine/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rat-moonshine\">@rat-moonshine</a> requested that we increase the timeout for authentication by push notification to 60 seconds.  The current timeout has been a problem for him in some cases.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/dpastov/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/dpastov\">@dpastov</a> reported that the default recommended by his library was 30 seconds.  This is hard-coded now.Some sources that <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/MarkProminic/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/MarkProminic\">@MarkProminic</a> found:<br>\n<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#:~:text=Table_content:%20header:%20%7C%20Title%20%7C%20TOTP:%20Time%2DBased,Pei%20%2C%20Salah%20Machani%20Email%20authors%20%7C\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#:~:text=Table_content:%20header:%20%7C%20Title%20%7C%20TOTP:%20Time%2DBased,Pei%20%2C%20Salah%20Machani%20Email%20authors%20%7C</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/03/towards-a-test-suite-for-totp-codes/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/03/towards-a-test-suite-for-totp-codes/</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#section-5.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#section-5.2</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We would like official approval from <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/JustinProminic/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/JustinProminic\">@JustinProminic</a> if we want to proceed with this, since it is potentially a security concern.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Do we want to make this configurable?   If so, we should clearly document the recommendations.</p>",
